Back to my first example, with plyr 1.1, now for the opposite problem:

library(plyr)
params <- expand.grid(a=1:2, b=1:2)

foo <- function(a,b) data.frame(x=rnorm(1), y=rnorm(1))
results <- mdply(params, foo)

  X1           x           y
1  1  1.60941600  0.31709424
2  2 -0.03412173  0.83205672
3  3  0.07964563 -0.60801311
4  4 -2.00250733 -0.04794103

